class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}productive}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{ProductiveVia}(P,p)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall e\\ [W_e\\subseteq P\\Rightarrow\\exists y\\ (p(e)\\downarrow=y\\land y\\in P\\setminus W_e)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Productive}(P)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1\\ \\operatorname{ProductiveVia}(P,p).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}productive}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{ProductiveVia}(P,p)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall e\\ [W_e\\subseteq P\\Rightarrow\\exists y\\ (p(e)\\downarrow=y\\land y\\in P\\setminus W_e)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Productive}(P)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1\\ \\operatorname{ProductiveVia}(P,p).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>生产函数允许在不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\\subseteq P\">\\(W_e\\subseteq P\\)</span> 的索引上发散。本书习题说明可进一步取全函数，但定义不先加入这个更强条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 2.4.3(i)；印刷页 38；PDF 第 74 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depen